<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Zenima Herbal Hair Oil</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #eef3ee;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 16px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #1f2933;
    }
    .card {
      max-width: 480px;
      margin: auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }
    .main-img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 300px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .gallery {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding: 10px 4px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .thumb {
      width: 68px;
      height: 68px;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .thumb.active {
      border-color: #1b4332;
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 12px 0 6px;
      font-size: 24px;
      color: #1b4332;
    }
    .price {
      font-size: 21px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #0f5132;
      background: #d1e7dd;
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      margin: 6px 0 10px;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #3e4c59;
      margin: 6px 0 14px;
    }
    .btn {
      display: block;
      padding: 13px 20px;
      background-color: #1b4332;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <img id="mainPhoto" class="main-img" src="zenima-oil.jpg" alt="Zenima Herbal Hair Oil">

    <div class="gallery">
      <img class="thumb active" src="zenima-oil.jpg" onclick="changePhoto(this)" alt="Photo 1">
      <img class="thumb" src="oil-2.jpg" onclick="changePhoto(this)" alt="Photo 2">
      <img class="thumb" src="oil-3.jpg" onclick="changePhoto(this)" alt="Photo 3">
      <img class="thumb" src="oil-4.jpg" onclick="changePhoto(this)" alt="Photo 4">
    </div>

    <h1>Zenima Herbal Hair Oil</h1>
    <div class="price">Rs. 1,000</div>
    <p>Herbal hair oil formulated to help strengthen hair, support thickness, and add natural shine. Tap any thumbnail below to view more photos.</p>

    <a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/923714178944?text=Hello%2C%20I%20want%20to%20order%20Zenima%20Herbal%20Hair%20Oil%20(Rs.%201%2C000)." target="_blank">Buy Now</a>
  </div>

  <script>
    function changePhoto(el) {
      document.getElementById("mainPhoto").src = el.src;
      document.querySelectorAll(".thumb").forEach(img => img.classList.remove("active"));
      el.classList.add("active");
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
